<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ lowers Pharmacia.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - DLJ lowers Pharmacia.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Donaldson, Lufkin and Jenrette analyst Kent Blair downgraded Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn to market perform, his office said.</p>
<p>-- The analyst was not immediately available for further details.</p>
<p>-- One market source said DLJ had previously rated Pharmacia &amp; Upjohn outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock was up 1/8 at 36-7/8.</p>
</text>
